    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Play, Stress-Free Fun!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monster Clicker</i> is a casual game that combines clicking, idle gameplay, and monster training. The controls are incredibly simple\u2014just click to attack, heal, or upgrade your monsters!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re a speed demon, focus on upgrading your &quot;Fingertip&quot; skill to make every click count!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer a more relaxed pace? Train your monsters to fight automatically while you sit back and relax!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409540/extras/a59897d0f67117c611a468bf8ad77e03.avif?t=1754892288\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Monsters, Build Your Ultimate Team!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>20+ unique heroes</strong>, each featuring multiple skins to unlock, the possibilities are endless!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different skins not only look awesome but also come with unique stats and skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team consists of <strong>front, middle, and back rows</strong>. Strategically position your heroes to dominate the battlefield!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your dream team and create an unstoppable monster squad!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409540/extras/abd094ba84892ba96a12ec7a90599b72.avif?t=1754892288\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Level Design, Challenge Your Limits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>100+ meticulously designed levels</strong>, each packed with surprises and challenges!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the Misty Forest, the Realm of Shadows Gorge, the Whirlwind Abyss, and the Silent Abyssal Sea\u2014every stage offers a unique adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a fresh test of your strategy and skills!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409540/extras/53c9907c517d1d0e271d1aed105883e5.avif?t=1754892288\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elemental Strategy, Master the Matchups!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters in the game possess <strong>9 different attributes</strong>, Wind, Thunder, Water, Fire, Earth, and more!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit elemental strengths and weaknesses to crush your enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic planning is the key to victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409540/extras/deee960c6b92dda1f1c6c8621b137b68.avif?t=1754892288\" width=650 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hands-Free Progression, Upgrade with Ease!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggling against a tough opponent? No problem!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idle mode lets you accumulate gold effortlessly. Take a tea break, and your monsters will grow stronger while you\u2019re away!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your monsters, enhance their skills, and dominate the competition with ease!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the World of <i>Monster Clicker</i> Today!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a casual player or a hardcore strategist, there\u2019s something here for everyone!<br>Click, idle, train, strategize\u2014all in <i>Monster Clicker</i>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Play, Stress-Free Fun!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monster Clicker</i> is a casual game that combines clicking, idle gameplay, and monster training. The controls are incredibly simple\u2014just click to attack, heal, or upgrade your monsters!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re a speed demon, focus on upgrading your &quot;Fingertip&quot; skill to make every click count!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer a more relaxed pace? Train your monsters to fight automatically while you sit back and relax!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409540/extras/a59897d0f67117c611a468bf8ad77e03.avif?t=1754892288\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Monsters, Build Your Ultimate Team!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>20+ unique heroes</strong>, each featuring multiple skins to unlock, the possibilities are endless!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different skins not only look awesome but also come with unique stats and skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team consists of <strong>front, middle, and back rows</strong>. Strategically position your heroes to dominate the battlefield!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your dream team and create an unstoppable monster squad!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409540/extras/abd094ba84892ba96a12ec7a90599b72.avif?t=1754892288\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Level Design, Challenge Your Limits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <s