er Clicker</i> Today!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a casual player or a hardcore strategist, there\u2019s something here for everyone!<br>Click, idle, train, strategize\u2014all in <i>Monster Clicker</i>!</p>",
